                "- Has access to: `adsk.core`, `adsk.fusion`, `math`, `traceback`, `time`\n"
                "- Use `adsk.core.Application.get()` to get the app\n"
                "- Cast active product: `adsk.fusion.Design.cast(app.activeProduct)`\n"
                "- Use `print()` for diagnostic output — stdout is captured and returned\n"
                "- Unit conversion: 1 cm (Fusion internal) = 10 mm → use `MM = 0.1` helper\n\n"
                "**Key Fusion API patterns (see system prompt for full reference):**\n"
                "- Rounded rectangles: helper function using sketchLines + sketchArcs\n"
                "- Deferred sketch compute: `sk.isComputeDeferred = True` for multi-curve sketches\n"
                "- Extrusion: `OffsetStartDefinition` + `DistanceExtentDefinition` + `setOneSideExtent`\n"
